{
  "id": "ss.relic.mine-chain",
  "name": "Spore chain",
  "description": "Two armed spore cases (`ss.proj.mine`, small) on one fuse, and the third case at the end of it already gone: an uneven cold burst with a near-white centre, five chips of its chitin shell in the air, and the length of fuse running into it lit while the length behind is still dead. The relic makes one blast set off every cache it reaches, so the drawing is the fuse doing exactly that, caught between the second case and the third. The burst has no dark middle — the centre is the brightest thing on the plate — and its spikes are unequal so it is an explosion rather than a star. It stays off ss.relic.mine by being a line of three going off instead of a heap of six waiting.",
